category: Libs
requires: libcosta2 pkg-config libevent-devel libhwloc-devel libscalapack-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Distributed Communication-Optimal Shuffle and Transpose Algorithm (development)"
ldesc: "COSTA is a communication-optimal, highly-optimised algorithm for data
redistribution accross multiple processors, using MPI and OpenMP and offering
the possibility to transpose and scale some or all data."
external-source: costa

